tour-settings-title = Mipangilio ya haraka
tour-settings-text = Badilisha kidirisha cha kusoma, msongamano na mandhari hapa. Ziara inaweza pia kuanzishwa tena kutoka hapo.
tour-account-title = Akaunti yako
tour-account-text = Ona uko kwenye akaunti ipi, na uongeze nyingine.

